  they accidentally turn onto a never-ending\, two-lane hellscape surrounde
 d by untold horrors and cosmic forces beyond their understanding. Cramped 
 together inside a Jeep Cherokee and with the miles stretching infinitely a
 head\, they face a choice: embrace their new existence or fight to escape 
 it.\nhttps://www.thetriplex.org/movie/it-ends\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: 
 https://pushpin.city/westernma/
